# 📘 Material Noun (पदार्थवाचक संज्ञा)

## परिभाषा (Definition):

**Material Noun** वह संज्ञा है जो किसी **पदार्थ (substance), धातु (metal), या द्रव्य (matter)** का नाम बताती है जिससे अन्य वस्तुएँ बनाई जाती हैं।

👉 इसे **गिना नहीं जा सकता (Uncountable)**, केवल **मापा जा सकता है**।

---

## ✨ Examples of Material Noun

| Material Noun | Meaning (Hindi) | Example Sentence                         |
| ------------- | --------------- | ---------------------------------------- |
| Gold          | सोना            | *The ring is made of gold.*              |
| Silver        | चाँदी           | *The necklace is made of silver.*        |
| Iron          | लोहा            | *The gate is made of iron.*              |
| Wood          | लकड़ी           | *The chair is made of wood.*             |
| Water         | पानी            | *Water is essential for life.*           |
| Milk          | दूध             | *Milk is good for health.*               |
| Rice          | चावल            | *Rice is a staple food in India.*        |
| Cotton        | कपास            | *This shirt is made of cotton.*          |
| Silk          | रेशम            | *The sari is made of silk.*              |
| Oil           | तेल             | *Oil is used for cooking.*               |
| Glass         | काँच            | *The window is made of glass.*           |
| Plastic       | प्लास्टिक       | *Plastic is harmful to the environment.* |
| Diamond       | हीरा            | *The diamond is very costly.*            |
| Sand          | रेत             | *Sand is used in construction.*          |
| Cement        | सीमेंट          | *Cement is used to build houses.*        |

---

## 📌 Rules of Material Noun

1. Material Noun **Uncountable** होते हैं।
   👉 ❌ *two golds* → ✔️ *two pieces of gold*

2. इनके साथ हमेशा **Singular Verb** आता है।
   👉 *Gold is precious.* (not **are**)

3. ये अक्सर **materials/substances** को दर्शाते हैं जिनसे दूसरी चीजें बनाई जाती हैं।

